    {
      "start_ms": 75920,
      "end_ms": 80640,
      "start": "00:01:15.920",
      "end": "00:01:20.640",
      "text": "everybody seeing as much as possible."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 78560,
      "end_ms": 82320,
      "start": "00:01:18.560",
      "end": "00:01:22.320",
      "text": "The winning team, GK Esports, is one of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 80640,
      "end_ms": 84320,
      "start": "00:01:20.640",
      "end": "00:01:24.320",
      "text": "the best examples of sight maxing I've"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 82320,
      "end_ms": 86560,
      "start": "00:01:22.320",
      "end": "00:01:26.560",
      "text": "ever seen in the sport. So, what exactly"
