    },
    {
      "start_ms": 92159,
      "end_ms": 96320,
      "start": "00:01:32.159",
      "end": "00:01:36.320",
      "text": "difficult to do in practice. Obviously,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 94560,
      "end_ms": 98159,
      "start": "00:01:34.560",
      "end": "00:01:38.159",
      "text": "I could sit in front of everybody if I'm"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 96320,
      "end_ms": 100320,
      "start": "00:01:36.320",
      "end": "00:01:40.320",
      "text": "lethal, for example, and just see"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 98159,
      "end_ms": 102400,
      "start": "00:01:38.159",
      "end": "00:01:42.400",
      "text": "everything. Also, obviously though, you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 100320,
      "end_ms": 104479,
      "start": "00:01:40.320",
      "end": "00:01:44.479",
      "text": "can't play here because you'll just die."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 102400,
      "end_ms": 106320,
      "start": "00:01:42.400",
      "end": "00:01:46.320",
