      "end": "00:01:48.880",
      "text": "the other teams? There's two examples"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 106320,
      "end_ms": 110720,
      "start": "00:01:46.320",
      "end": "00:01:50.720",
      "text": "we'll look at. And the first one, GK is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 108880,
      "end_ms": 112240,
      "start": "00:01:48.880",
      "end": "00:01:52.240",
      "text": "defending circuit. Second point,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 110720,
      "end_ms": 114479,
      "start": "00:01:50.720",
      "end": "00:01:54.479",
      "text": "nightmares retaken here across the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 112240,
      "end_ms": 116320,
      "start": "00:01:52.240",
      "end": "00:01:56.320",
      "text": "corner. If you look at what everybody"
