      "start_ms": 183200,
      "end_ms": 188560,
      "start": "00:03:03.200",
      "end": "00:03:08.560",
      "text": "sees one person, Rocket sees one person,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 186319,
      "end_ms": 190800,
      "start": "00:03:06.319",
      "end": "00:03:10.800",
      "text": "Chronic doesn't see anyone, and Lap and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 188560,
      "end_ms": 192239,
      "start": "00:03:08.560",
      "end": "00:03:12.239",
      "text": "Luke also don't see anyone. The GK"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 190800,
      "end_ms": 194239,
      "start": "00:03:10.800",
      "end": "00:03:14.239",
      "text": "players, however, know where everybody"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 192239,
      "end_ms": 196080,
      "start": "00:03:12.239",
      "end": "00:03:16.080",
      "text": "on Nightmare is. We just poked them and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 194239,
      "end_ms": 197840,
      "start": "00:03:14.239",
      "end": "00:03:17.840",
      "text": "gave the corner on purpose. This means"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 196080,
      "end_ms": 201080,
      "start": "00:03:16.080",
      "end": "00:03:21.080",
      "text": "we can camp the corner and go whenever"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 197840,
      "end_ms": 201080,
      "start": "00:03:17.840",
      "end": "00:03:21.080",
      "text": "we want."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 203680,
      "end_ms": 210040,
      "start": "00:03:23.680",
      "end": "00:03:30.040",
      "text": "This ends now. This is an easy slam dunk"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 206080,
      "end_ms": 210040,
      "start": "00:03:26.080",
      "end": "00:03:30.040",
      "text": "overclock for lethal. Here"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 213599,
      "end_ms": 217120,
      "start": "00:03:33.599",
      "end": "00:03:37.120",
      "text": "on New Junk City, the roles are"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 214879,
      "end_ms": 219360,
      "start": "00:03:34.879",
      "end": "00:03:39.360",
      "text": "reversed. Nightmare has the same general"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 217120,
      "end_ms": 221519,
      "start": "00:03:37.120",
      "end": "00:03:41.519",
      "text": "plan to overclock first that GK did on"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 219360,
      "end_ms": 223599,
      "start": "00:03:39.360",
      "end": "00:03:43.599",
      "text": "Circuit. The big difference, however, is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 221519,
      "end_ms": 224959,
      "start": "00:03:41.519",
      "end": "00:03:44.959",
      "text": "the sight maxing. If you look at the way"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 223599,
      "end_ms": 226480,
      "start": "00:03:43.599",
      "end": "00:03:46.480",
      "text": "Nightmare sets up in between these"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 224959,
      "end_ms": 228480,
      "start": "00:03:44.959",
      "end": "00:03:48.480",
      "text": "fights, it becomes obvious how different"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 226480,
      "end_ms": 231799,
      "start": "00:03:46.480",
      "end": "00:03:51.799",
      "text": "it is from what GK is doing. Let's watch"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 228480,
      "end_ms": 231799,
      "start": "00:03:48.480",
      "end": "00:03:51.799",
      "text": "them set up."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 234159,
      "end_ms": 237439,
      "start": "00:03:54.159",
      "end": "00:03:57.439",
      "text": "They've been given an inch and they took"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 235760,
      "end_ms": 239599,
      "start": "00:03:55.760",
      "end": "00:03:59.599",
      "text": "one inch. You're supposed to take a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 237439,
      "end_ms": 241280,
      "start": "00:03:57.439",
      "end": "00:04:01.280",
      "text": "mile. We need to start in a position"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 239599,
      "end_ms": 243120,
      "start": "00:03:59.599",
      "end": "00:04:03.120",
      "text": "where we can see them before they get to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 241280,
      "end_ms": 244400,
      "start": "00:04:01.280",
      "end": "00:04:04.400",
      "text": "set up at all. And if we decide we don't"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 243120,
      "end_ms": 245519,
      "start": "00:04:03.120",
      "end": "00:04:05.519",
      "text": "want to fight there, then we can back up"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 244400,
      "end_ms": 247120,
      "start": "00:04:04.400",
      "end": "00:04:07.120",
      "text": "to the real position we're going to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 245519,
      "end_ms": 248480,
      "start": "00:04:05.519",
      "end": "00:04:08.480",
      "text": "fight from. Here, all the nightmare"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 247120,
      "end_ms": 250720,
      "start": "00:04:07.120",
      "end": "00:04:10.720",
      "text": "players start in the position they want"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 248480,
      "end_ms": 252480,
      "start": "00:04:08.480",
      "end": "00:04:12.480",
      "text": "to fight from. This means GK gets the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 250720,
      "end_ms": 253599,
      "start": "00:04:10.720",
      "end": "00:04:13.599",
      "text": "chance to outplay them. If you quickly"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 252480,
      "end_ms": 255920,
      "start": "00:04:12.480",
      "end": "00:04:15.920",
      "text": "flip through all the nightmare players"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 253599,
      "end_ms": 257600,
      "start": "00:04:13.599",
      "end": "00:04:17.600",
      "text": "POVs, it becomes super obvious. Rocket's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 255920,
      "end_ms": 259680,
      "start": "00:04:15.920",
      "end": "00:04:19.680",
      "text": "looking at a wall. Chronic is looking at"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 257600,
      "end_ms": 261519,
      "start": "00:04:17.600",
      "end": "00:04:21.519",
      "text": "a wall. Painkiller is looking at a wall."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 259680,
      "end_ms": 263600,
      "start": "00:04:19.680",
      "end": "00:04:23.600",
      "text": "Lep is looking at a wall. And Luke is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 261519,
      "end_ms": 265600,
      "start": "00:04:21.519",
      "end": "00:04:25.600",
      "text": "also looking at a wall. We are wall"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 263600,
      "end_ms": 266880,
      "start": "00:04:23.600",
      "end": "00:04:26.880",
      "text": "maxing. Unfortunately, that means we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 265600,
      "end_ms": 268320,
      "start": "00:04:25.600",
      "end": "00:04:28.320",
      "text": "miss the timing for the overclock. And"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 266880,
      "end_ms": 270240,
      "start": "00:04:26.880",
      "end": "00:04:30.240",
      "text": "they're able to force out rocket hard"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 268320,
      "end_ms": 271840,
      "start": "00:04:28.320",
      "end": "00:04:31.840",
      "text": "before anybody does anything. This is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 270240,
      "end_ms": 273919,
      "start": "00:04:30.240",
      "end": "00:04:33.919",
      "text": "the difference maker between going first"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 271840,
      "end_ms": 276000,
      "start": "00:04:31.840",
      "end": "00:04:36.000",
      "text": "and dying. Another difficult example"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 273919,
      "end_ms": 277600,
      "start": "00:04:33.919",
      "end": "00:04:37.600",
      "text": "comes from SSG. In this fight from when"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 276000,
      "end_ms": 280240,
      "start": "00:04:36.000",
      "end": "00:04:40.240",
      "text": "they played Nightmare, both teams just"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 277600,
      "end_ms": 282479,
      "start": "00:04:37.600",
      "end": "00:04:42.479",
      "text": "have both DPS. If you watch the way the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 280240,
      "end_ms": 284000,
      "start": "00:04:40.240",
      "end": "00:04:44.000",
      "text": "SSG sets themselves up to see things in"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 282479,
      "end_ms": 285759,
      "start": "00:04:42.479",
      "end": "00:04:45.759",
      "text": "this fight, you'll notice that they"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 284000,
      "end_ms": 287360,
      "start": "00:04:44.000",
      "end": "00:04:47.360",
      "text": "effectively see nothing. The important"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 285759,
      "end_ms": 289199,
      "start": "00:04:45.759",
      "end": "00:04:49.199",
      "text": "things I need to see to not let the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 287360,
      "end_ms": 290800,
      "start": "00:04:47.360",
      "end": "00:04:50.800",
      "text": "enemy team set up first is I need to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 289199,
      "end_ms": 292560,
      "start": "00:04:49.199",
      "end": "00:04:52.560",
      "text": "know who is going here and I need to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 290800,
      "end_ms": 294240,
      "start": "00:04:50.800",
      "end": "00:04:54.240",
      "text": "know who was turning this corner. I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 292560,
      "end_ms": 296160,
      "start": "00:04:52.560",
      "end": "00:04:56.160",
      "text": "can't let the Genji or the Sojun get"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 294240,
      "end_ms": 298880,
      "start": "00:04:54.240",
      "end": "00:04:58.880",
      "text": "here to and I can't let the Sojun get"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 296160,
      "end_ms": 301120,
      "start": "00:04:56.160",
      "end": "00:05:01.120",
      "text": "here to. I absolutely definitely cannot"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 298880,
      "end_ms": 302479,
      "start": "00:04:58.880",
      "end": "00:05:02.479",
      "text": "let either enemy DPS get here to or the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 301120,
      "end_ms": 303919,
      "start": "00:05:01.120",
      "end": "00:05:03.919",
      "text": "game is over. So, what kind of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 302479,
      "end_ms": 305280,
      "start": "00:05:02.479",
      "end": "00:05:05.280",
      "text": "positioning would I like from everyone?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 303919,
      "end_ms": 307120,
      "start": "00:05:03.919",
      "end": "00:05:07.120",
      "text": "Well, we're coming back from spawn, but"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 305280,
      "end_ms": 309280,
      "start": "00:05:05.280",
      "end": "00:05:09.280",
      "text": "if we have time, I want to see here. I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 307120,
      "end_ms": 310960,
      "start": "00:05:07.120",
      "end": "00:05:10.960",
      "text": "want to see here and I want to see here."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 309280,
      "end_ms": 314360,
      "start": "00:05:09.280",
      "end": "00:05:14.360",
      "text": "Let's take a look at what SSG actually"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 310960,
      "end_ms": 314360,
      "start": "00:05:10.960",
      "end": "00:05:14.360",
      "text": "ends up seeing."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 321039,
      "end_ms": 324880,
      "start": "00:05:21.039",
      "end": "00:05:24.880",
      "text": "So, what happened? Rocket gets to set up"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 323120,
      "end_ms": 326240,
      "start": "00:05:23.120",
      "end": "00:05:26.240",
      "text": "top left. He's going to pull his blade"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 324880,
      "end_ms": 328240,
      "start": "00:05:24.880",
      "end": "00:05:28.240",
      "text": "out because we aren't able to stop his"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 326240,
      "end_ms": 332600,
      "start": "00:05:26.240",
      "end": "00:05:32.600",
      "text": "setup. And when Rocket is in the air and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 328240,
      "end_ms": 332600,
      "start": "00:05:28.240",
      "end": "00:05:32.600",
      "text": "we hear the Genji voice line of doom,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 332880,
      "end_ms": 339520,
      "start": "00:05:32.880",
      "end": "00:05:39.520",
      "text": "what do you think everybody sees?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 335280,
      "end_ms": 341199,
      "start": "00:05:35.280",
      "end": "00:05:41.199",
      "text": "Nothing. Nothing. Nothing. Nothing. And"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 339520,
      "end_ms": 342479,
      "start": "00:05:39.520",
      "end": "00:05:42.479",
      "text": "nothing. Unfortunately, Rocket is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 341199,
      "end_ms": 345960,
      "start": "00:05:41.199",
      "end": "00:05:45.960",
      "text": "invisible and he's going to kill our"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 342479,
      "end_ms": 345960,
      "start": "00:05:42.479",
      "end": "00:05:45.960",
      "text": "whole team. Now,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 348240,
      "end_ms": 352080,
      "start": "00:05:48.240",
      "end": "00:05:52.080",
      "text": "if we want one more good example, we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 350160,
      "end_ms": 355880,
      "start": "00:05:50.160",
      "end": "00:05:55.880",
      "text": "have to go back to GK. Here, we want to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 352080,
      "end_ms": 355880,
      "start": "00:05:52.080",
      "end": "00:05:55.880",
      "text": "fight around the middle of Runasappi."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 358320,
      "end_ms": 361759,
      "start": "00:05:58.320",
      "end": "00:06:01.759",
      "text": "The fight was one in the middle of the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 359680,
      "end_ms": 363280,
      "start": "00:05:59.680",
      "end": "00:06:03.280",
      "text": "map. The card is here. If you had to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 361759,
      "end_ms": 365039,
      "start": "00:06:01.759",
      "end": "00:06:05.039",
      "text": "guess where GK is going to set up,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 363280,
      "end_ms": 367039,
      "start": "00:06:03.280",
      "end": "00:06:07.039",
      "text": "where's it going to be? If you guessed"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 365039,
      "end_ms": 371080,
      "start": "00:06:05.039",
      "end": "00:06:11.080",
      "text": "here overclocking in spawn, then you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 367039,
      "end_ms": 371080,
      "start": "00:06:07.039",
      "end": "00:06:11.080",
      "text": "correct. Hello."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 372639,
      "end_ms": 376560,
      "start": "00:06:12.639",
      "end": "00:06:16.560",
      "text": "Lethal quickly sets up so he can see"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 374720,
      "end_ms": 378319,
      "start": "00:06:14.720",
      "end": "00:06:18.319",
      "text": "everybody on Liquid before anybody is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 376560,
      "end_ms": 380160,
      "start": "00:06:16.560",
      "end": "00:06:20.160",
      "text": "able to set up. Lethal has visual"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 378319,
      "end_ms": 381520,
      "start": "00:06:18.319",
      "end": "00:06:21.520",
      "text": "control of the entire walk up. An"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 380160,
      "end_ms": 383039,
      "start": "00:06:20.160",
      "end": "00:06:23.039",
      "text": "overclock here is probably not going to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 381520,
      "end_ms": 385280,
      "start": "00:06:21.520",
      "end": "00:06:25.280",
      "text": "get many kills, but it's going to allow"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 383039,
      "end_ms": 387039,
      "start": "00:06:23.039",
      "end": "00:06:27.039",
      "text": "GK to constantly stay in control of the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 385280,
      "end_ms": 388880,
      "start": "00:06:25.280",
      "end": "00:06:28.880",
      "text": "setup. Liquid is forced to hide and they"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 387039,
      "end_ms": 390560,
      "start": "00:06:27.039",
      "end": "00:06:30.560",
      "text": "want to re-engage afterwards. However,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 388880,
      "end_ms": 392319,
      "start": "00:06:28.880",
      "end": "00:06:32.319",
      "text": "because of the way GK played this early"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 390560,
      "end_ms": 394319,
      "start": "00:06:30.560",
      "end": "00:06:34.319",
      "text": "fight in the early overclock, look at"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 392319,
      "end_ms": 397120,
      "start": "00:06:32.319",
      "end": "00:06:37.120",
      "text": "what everybody on Liquid can see. Tree"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 394319,
      "end_ms": 398960,
      "start": "00:06:34.319",
      "end": "00:06:38.960",
      "text": "sees a bit. Zer sees nothing. Infected"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 397120,
      "end_ms": 400720,
      "start": "00:06:37.120",
      "end": "00:06:40.720",
      "text": "sees one person. RuPaul sees nothing."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 398960,
      "end_ms": 402479,
      "start": "00:06:38.960",
      "end": "00:06:42.479",
      "text": "And Vega sees nothing. If you've watched"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 400720,
      "end_ms": 406440,
      "start": "00:06:40.720",
      "end": "00:06:46.440",
      "text": "my video about getting off the corner,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 402479,
      "end_ms": 406440,
      "start": "00:06:42.479",
      "end": "00:06:46.440",
      "text": "you know what's about to happen here."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 409039,
      "end_ms": 413520,
      "start": "00:06:49.039",
      "end": "00:06:53.520",
      "text": "Vega is absolutely obliterated on this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 411360,
      "end_ms": 415680,
      "start": "00:06:51.360",
      "end": "00:06:55.680",
      "text": "corner. Let's get an instant replay of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 413520,
      "end_ms": 418319,
      "start": "00:06:53.520",
      "end": "00:06:58.319",
      "text": "exactly what Vega was able to see before"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 415680,
      "end_ms": 419919,
      "start": "00:06:55.680",
      "end": "00:06:59.919",
      "text": "going into this fight."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 418319,
      "end_ms": 422080,
      "start": "00:06:58.319",
      "end": "00:07:02.080",
      "text": "If I'm liquid and I want to find a way"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 419919,
      "end_ms": 423840,
      "start": "00:06:59.919",
      "end": "00:07:03.840",
      "text": "to beat or rush engage here, I need to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 422080,
      "end_ms": 425840,
      "start": "00:07:02.080",
      "end": "00:07:05.840",
      "text": "find a way to see everybody before we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 423840,
      "end_ms": 427680,
      "start": "00:07:03.840",
      "end": "00:07:07.680",
      "text": "start fighting for setup. Tree wants to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 425840,
      "end_ms": 430000,
      "start": "00:07:05.840",
      "end": "00:07:10.000",
      "text": "get over here. Give him some time to do"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 427680,
      "end_ms": 431599,
      "start": "00:07:07.680",
      "end": "00:07:11.599",
      "text": "it. Somebody go with him. If you find"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 430000,
      "end_ms": 432880,
      "start": "00:07:10.000",
      "end": "00:07:12.880",
      "text": "yourself struggling to fight for setups,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 431599,
      "end_ms": 434639,
      "start": "00:07:11.599",
      "end": "00:07:14.639",
      "text": "and if you find yourself struggling to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 432880,
      "end_ms": 436880,
      "start": "00:07:12.880",
      "end": "00:07:16.880",
      "text": "go first, go back to every fight and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 434639,
      "end_ms": 438639,
      "start": "00:07:14.639",
      "end": "00:07:18.639",
      "text": "evaluate what your players can see. If"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 436880,
      "end_ms": 440400,
      "start": "00:07:16.880",
      "end": "00:07:20.400",
      "text": "the enemy team just went first, were you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 438639,
      "end_ms": 442560,
      "start": "00:07:18.639",
      "end": "00:07:22.560",
      "text": "able to see them? Where should you have"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 440400,
      "end_ms": 444160,
      "start": "00:07:20.400",
      "end": "00:07:24.160",
      "text": "poked pre-fight to be able to see them?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 442560,
      "end_ms": 446479,
      "start": "00:07:22.560",
      "end": "00:07:26.479",
      "text": "Should you have used null earlier to be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 444160,
      "end_ms": 448080,
      "start": "00:07:24.160",
      "end": "00:07:28.080",
      "text": "able to poke? The fight winner is the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 446479,
      "end_ms": 449599,
      "start": "00:07:26.479",
      "end": "00:07:29.599",
      "text": "team with the better setup. But the team"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 448080,
      "end_ms": 451120,
      "start": "00:07:28.080",
      "end": "00:07:31.120",
      "text": "with the better setup is almost always"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 449599,
      "end_ms": 453039,
      "start": "00:07:29.599",
      "end": "00:07:33.039",
      "text": "the team that has better sight going"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 451120,
      "end_ms": 454400,
      "start": "00:07:31.120",
      "end": "00:07:34.400",
      "text": "into the fight. My next video will"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 453039,
      "end_ms": 455599,
      "start": "00:07:33.039",
      "end": "00:07:35.599",
      "text": "probably be more in depth about how to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 454400,
      "end_ms": 457759,
      "start": "00:07:34.400",
      "end": "00:07:37.759",
      "text": "set up and how to fight for these"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 455599,
      "end_ms": 459919,
      "start": "00:07:35.599",
      "end": "00:07:39.919",
      "text": "setups. But before you can worry about"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 457759,
      "end_ms": 461280,
      "start": "00:07:37.759",
      "end": "00:07:41.280",
      "text": "that, you need to worry about this. In"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 459919,
      "end_ms": 462560,
      "start": "00:07:39.919",
      "end": "00:07:42.560",
      "text": "order to start playing like this in your"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 461280,
      "end_ms": 464560,
      "start": "00:07:41.280",
      "end": "00:07:44.560",
      "text": "games, this is what you need to think"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 462560,
      "end_ms": 466720,
      "start": "00:07:42.560",
      "end": "00:07:46.720",
      "text": "of. Whenever you're poking in between"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 464560,
      "end_ms": 468319,
      "start": "00:07:44.560",
      "end": "00:07:48.319",
      "text": "fights, what can you see? Is there"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 466720,
      "end_ms": 470479,
      "start": "00:07:46.720",
      "end": "00:07:50.479",
      "text": "anywhere someone could set up outside"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 468319,
      "end_ms": 471919,
      "start": "00:07:48.319",
      "end": "00:07:51.919",
      "text": "your field of vision? Is there somewhere"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 470479,
      "end_ms": 473919,
      "start": "00:07:50.479",
      "end": "00:07:53.919",
      "text": "farther up you could be poking or"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 471919,
      "end_ms": 475599,
      "start": "00:07:51.919",
      "end": "00:07:55.599",
      "text": "scouting where you could see everything?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 473919,
      "end_ms": 478599,
      "start": "00:07:53.919",
      "end": "00:07:58.599",
      "text": "Am I trying to poke from here in between"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 475599,
      "end_ms": 478599,
      "start": "00:07:55.599",
      "end": "00:07:58.599",
      "text": "fights"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 480879,
      "end_ms": 488599,
      "start": "00:08:00.879",
      "end": "00:08:08.599",
      "text": "or here? Here or here?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 485599,
      "end_ms": 488599,
      "start": "00:08:05.599",
      "end": "00:08:08.599",
      "text": "Here"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 491919,
      "end_ms": 496000,
      "start": "00:08:11.919",
      "end": "00:08:16.000",
      "text": "or here? It's important to make sure you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 494479,
      "end_ms": 497759,
      "start": "00:08:14.479",
      "end": "00:08:17.759",
      "text": "don't fight too hard without a good"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 496000,
      "end_ms": 500319,
      "start": "00:08:16.000",
      "end": "00:08:20.319",
      "text": "reason during this phase and back up to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 497759,
      "end_ms": 501919,
      "start": "00:08:17.759",
      "end": "00:08:21.919",
      "text": "your real spa before you get forced out."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 500319,
      "end_ms": 505879,
      "start": "00:08:20.319",
      "end": "00:08:25.879",
      "text": "Don't use what I'm saying as an excuse"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 501919,
      "end_ms": 505879,
      "start": "00:08:21.919",
      "end": "00:08:25.879",
      "text": "to die in the enemy spawn."
    }
  ]
}
